# Keep history, CI config, the abandoned Gatsby wrapper (luwah-resume/, an
# unbuildable sibling project that only iframes a dead URL) and CI helper
# scripts out of the image. Also keep secrets out of a local build context.
.git
.github
luwah-resume
scripts
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
**/secrets.toml
**/__pycache__
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
Readme.md
